  "reception_note_ja": "ゼッケンの事前送付はなく、当日8:00〜9:00に受付場所（新横浜駅前公園東側のあずまや）でエントリーサイトの決済ページを提示して受け取ります。受付時間に遅れると出走できません。",
  "reception_note_en": "Bibs are not mailed in advance. Pick up your bib on race day between 8:00 and 9:00 at the pavilion on the east side of Shin-Yokohama Station Front Park by showing the payment page of the entry site. Runners who miss the reception time cannot start.",
